================================================================================
LICENSING — Dhātupāṭha Analysis Bundle
================================================================================

This bundle contains two kinds of files with distinct licensing situations:

  (A) Original Python scripts authored for this bundle (in scripts/):
      Licensed MIT — see below.

  (B) Source data (data/dhatupatha.csv):
      Sourced from github.com/sanskrit/vyakarana, which did not carry an
      explicit license at time of preparation.  See README.md for attribution
      and redistribution-status notes.  The underlying Dhātupāṭha as a
      canonical Sanskrit text is in the public domain.

  (C) Derived data (data/derived/dhatupatha_decomposed.md):
      Generated by decompose_dhatupatha.py from (B).  Released under the
      Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license (CC-BY-4.0).
      Cite as: Parag Tope, *Dhātupāṭha Analysis — Reproducibility Bundle*,
      accompanying *Atomic Sanskrit* (2026), CC-BY-4.0.

